<title>SINGAPORE: Shangri-La suspended pending announcement.</title>
<headline>Shangri-La suspended pending announcement.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shangri-La Hotel Ltd in a statement released on Tuesday requested the suspension of its shares on Wednesday pending an announcement.</p>
<p>The shares were last traded at Singapore $4.90 on Monday.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom 65-8703080 sbn</p>
</text>
